[N 54-60 24 Dire Maul (North)][GL OFF]
[D RestedXP Forever dungeon quest guides: pick up and complete all quests for one dungeon. Converted from the RestedXP guide for Guidelime. Start at level 54 or higher for all required pickups.]
[GA Alliance]
[A IT18258<1][O]If you still need a *Gordok Ogre Suit* for Tribute, buy one or bring these supplies to *Knot Thimblejack* and loot *Ogre Tannin* inside the dungeon \\ Collect [CI14048,4] \\ Collect [CI8170,8] \\ Collect [CI14341,2]
For a Tribute run, bring the trap supplies below. To open the locked door, bring a Rogue with 300 Lockpicking, a *Powerful Seaforium Charge* or a *Truesilver Skeleton Key* \\ Tick this step if you are doing a normal clear \\ Collect [CI15994,1] \\ Collect [CI3829,1]
[OC]Travel to Feralas
[G 31.8,44.4 Feralas]Talk to *Scholar Runethorn* \\ *Scholar Runethorn* patrols slightly through Feathermoon Stronghold \\ Accept [QA7482 Elven Legends]
[G 62.8,24.88,15 Feralas]Enter Dire Maul (North)
Click the *Skeletal Remains of Telmius Dreamseeker* inside the Dire Maul Library \\ This is located beside *Lorekeeper Lydros* \\ [QC7482,1 Elven Legends]
If you are doing a Tribute run: \\ Completely avoid *Guard Mol'dar*, *Guard Fengus* and *Stomper Kreeg* \\ Make sure someone in your party loots *Fengus's Chest* for the *Gordok Courtyard Key* \\ Use the materials acquired earlier to trap *Guard Slip'kik* \\ Head up the ramp and loot the *Ogre Tannin*, then return below to *Knot Thimblejack* to make the *Gordok Ogre Suit* if you didn't buy one \\ Talk to *Captain Kromcrush* while wearing the *Gordok Ogre Suit* \\ Kill *King Gordok*. Keep *Cho'Rush the Observer* alive \\ Skip this step if you are doing a normal clear
[O]After a Tribute run, if you are level 56 or higher and *Captain Kromcrush* offers his quest, talk to him before leaving \\ Accept [QA7703 Unfinished Gordok Business]
[O]If you took *Unfinished Gordok Business*, loot the *Gauntlet of Gordok Might* from *The Prince's Chest* in the Dire Maul West library \\ [QC7703,1 Unfinished Gordok Business]
[A IT18336][O]Once you have the gauntlet, return to *Captain Kromcrush* in Dire Maul North. Keep him alive during the run \\ Turn in [QT7703 Unfinished Gordok Business]
Complete Dire Maul (North). Exit the instance once complete.
